window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Welcome back to The Indigo lounge, the scandalously sexy playground where anything can happen. Flirty, dirty, and utterly decadent, High Sea Seduction takes you from the sky to the sea. Perfect for fans of Sadie Kincaid, Jodi Ellen Malpa, Sylvia Day, Navessa Allen and S.T Abby</p> <p><b>From Jumbo Jets…</b></p> <p>I was told once my big mouth would get me into trouble, But I didn’t expect the hottest man I’d ever seen to hear me confess my severe lack of…bedroom antics. When I throw myself into the chilling sea, he thinks he’s rescuing me from embarrassment but there’s always…always more. I should resist Mason. But the demons in his eyes call to mine. And how I can I resist the dark promises he makes?</p> <p><b>…To Super Yachts</b></p> <p>I was only supposed to be here for my best friend’s engagement party. But then I saw her. Mouthy. Sexy. Broken. My time in the jungle hasn’t lessened the agony of my loss but…maybe I didn’t need to return just yet. When Zach asks me to help launch his new Indigo Lounge venture, I accept on one condition. I want to tame the girl with the potty mouth and the siren body. Keely quieted my demons for a hot second. So even if I can never be whole again, at least we can be broken together.</p>"; 
